{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>Thirty cubits.</b> For when their length is laid across the width of the Mishkan, as he laid the first set, these are found to overhang one cubit on this side and one cubit on that side, to cover one of the two cubits that remained exposed of the planks. And the bottom cubit of the plank, which the curtain does not cover, is the cubit inserted into the socket of the base — for the bases were one cubit high."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:54:40.054006047Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}